  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1065\">\n<p data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1065\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"951\">S-100</strong>:<br data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"955\">Highly sensitive but less specific. Positive in most melanomas, also in Langerhans cells, glial tumors, etc.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1168\">\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1168\"><strong data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1079\">HMB-45</strong>:<br data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1083\">More specific to melanocytic tumors. Strong positivity supports melanoma diagnosis.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1258\">\n<p data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1258\"><strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1183\">Melan-A</strong>:<br data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1187\">Specific for melanocytic origin. Helps confirm melanocytic neoplasms.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
